PrivateBin
----------

PrivateBin was studied as conceptual inspiration for client-side-encrypted
sharing, encrypted metadata, explicit burn-after-reading behavior, deletion
capabilities, and security-oriented product language. No PrivateBin source code
or artwork is included in Nyanbin, and Nyanbin is not wire-compatible with
PrivateBin.

Upstream project: https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin
Studied revision: 88cf90534de33f950411c12cdee87d841d97947c

PrivateBin and its contributors do not endorse Nyanbin.

