Dependencies and assets
------------------------

Third-party dependencies and bundled assets remain subject to their respective
licenses and notices. The root MIT License covers Nyanbin's original work and
preserves Cryptgeon's MIT notice; it does not replace the licenses of those
third-party components.

The concrete, generated inventory is `DEPENDENCY_LICENSES.csv`. It records the
locked pnpm production dependency graph, the locked Rust dependency graph, and
the fonts and other assets bundled in release artifacts. Regenerate it with
`pnpm licenses:generate` after dependency or bundled-asset changes.
